# Raiden Durin Xiangling Nicole. ~20s Rot. Raiden Overload. Raiden Q N4E 2N4D N4. Xiangling catches Durin's particles. Xiangling shreds Pyro for Durin. Vs opponenents of signiciant size, can double hit for + ~9K damage.

# Team - OPtions listed by DPS
raiden char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
raiden add weapon="deathmatch" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
raiden add set="emblem" count=4;
#raiden add set="tom" count=4;
